---
import {clientNeeds} from '../data/commercial';
---
<section class="client-needs" aria-labelledby="needs-title"><div class="section-intro"><h2 id="needs-title">Start with what your<br/>market needs to do.</h2><p>Turn a liquidity problem into an operating objective.</p></div><div class="need-rows">{clientNeeds.map(item=><article><h3>{item.problem}</h3><p>{item.objective}</p><a href={item.link}>{item.label}</a></article>)}</div><p class="section-footnote">Objectives depend on the market, available capital and agreed limits. They are not promises of price appreciation or trading volume.</p></section>
